      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1820s, gold discovered about 45 miles north of today’s Johns Creek sparked America’s second major Gold Rush and accelerated the Cherokee Nation’s forced removal.",
